  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cyclone response  - rebuilding of schools</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to the national cyclone response for education sector through ILO&#x2019;s emergency project  of rebuilding destroyed school infrastructures in the most hit areas to ensure continuity of education for school children deprived of classes. The rebuilding of disability-sensitive 22 schools will provide training and employment for local youth with strict observance of gender parity according to ILO regulations on recruitment. The support is intended to have a catalytic effect for mobilising more funding to the disaster response.</narrative>
  </description>
